### Expected Impact on Differentiation

**Before Enhancements:**
- Single optimal strategy per year
- Deterministic outcomes
- Implementation quality = main differentiator

**After Enhancements:**
- Multiple viable strategies (risk-averse vs aggressive)
- Uncertainty requires hedging and adaptation
